  data: {
    LLM: 'Game: Democracy. Resolve simultaneous card reveals, apply trump and special rank rules, and score tribal suit control.',
    Player: 'Select a card that can win this reveal while denying opponents critical suit-majority points.',
    objective: "Collect majority of points in suits to score 'tribes' (game points). First player to reach agreed number of tribes (usually 5, 7, or 10) wins the match.",
    gameplay: "1. Dealer flips card from voting pool to determine trump suit\n2. Each player selects one card from hand and places it face down\n3. On dealer's signal, all simultaneously reveal cards\n4. If trumps played: highest trump wins (except 6 beats 5 of trumps if both played)\n5. If no trumps: highest card wins regardless of suit\n6. Winner takes all played cards and voting card\n7. In case of tie for highest (no trumps): each takes own card, voting card discarded\n8. Jokers can represent any non-trump card\n9. Continue until all cards played, then score",
